From b0f944e697b6d4492784b08c7570cf81b97f3f41 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 20:05:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] entities-in-box and teleport-entity (round 4 item 3, API 49)

entities-in-box lists mobs, items, boats, minecarts, mod entities and players
with their feet in a box, nearest the middle first. teleport-entity moves a
non-player entity: in the same level at once with its mob riders; to another
level through the portal arrival queue with an exact landing point (no portal
search, no portal cooldown), saved until the chunks there load. Example
teleport-probe.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
